        "product_summary": "Dial-and-cord fastening: A rotary dial routes the front cord through four pairs of fabric guides instead of traditional tied laces.\nMesh-panel upper: Open-textured forefoot and side sections meet a curved stitched toe overlay.\nOutlined side design: A large angular dark panel with a white border gives this style a distinctive side profile.\nLow-top construction: A rear fabric pull loop, dark textile collar and pale sculpted sidewall complete the design.\nBlack and Grey EU 39–48: Two neutral colour options and ten EU sizes support a practical wholesale assortment.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
